  "preceding_paragraph": "Table S4 | Strict retained-corpus comparison of the six-channel fusion engine followed by one graph-aggregation step, projection residual and cosine 1-NN. Each value is mean ± sample s.d. over five measurement-noise realizations (seeds 41, 141, 241, 341 and 441; 540 fixed queries per realization; Gaussian component s.d. 0.02 m). All data-dependent numeric, semantic and community artifacts are rebuilt from retained scenarios. Top-1 and Top-3 are percentages; RR is full-ranking reciprocal rank multiplied by 100. All methods obey the represented-label candidate contract; projection and cosine additionally exclude zero-response templates. H9 is a label-support integrity check and does not measure unseen-partition generalization. The legacy comparison and open-label diagnostic are archived separately.",
